{'symbol': 'MPC', 'date': '2021-10-27 15:30:00', 'title': 'MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'FINDLAY, OHIO, OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. (NYSE: MPC) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.58 PER SHARE ON COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE DEC. 10,\xa02021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS NOV. 17,\xa02021.'}